{"synopsis":"00400Streamer dengan subcriber jutaan, Spicy Fabre, dikenal sebagai ahlinya racun dan serangga beracun mati tergigit ular black mamba dalam perjalanan memotret di afrika dan mengalami reinkarnasi ke dunia murim.\n\nStreamer yang memelihara banyak serangga beracun di dalam hutan menarik perhatian klan tang dari sichuan, klan yang terkenal karena kemampuan mereka dalam hal racun, sekarang mereka menginginkannya.\n\n“Bergabunglah dengan kami dan jadilah anggota klan.”","alternative_title":"파브르 in 사천당가, The Poison Master of Sacheon Tang Clan, A Poison Master in the Sichuan Tang Clan","author":"Erhut, Jidaegong Mabeobsonyeon","artist":"Kraken","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"34fb68b0-2805-46d3-82eb-35d51f624338","number":"99","chapter":"99","title":"Chapter 99","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"a15b6b1d-497a-43f5-8e39-afca32c33486","number":"98","chapter":"98","title":"Chapter 98","date":"2026-07-27","released":"2026-07-27","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"267eb08a-80a3-486a-87e8-c4391f9a636b","number":"97","chapter":"97","title":"Chapter 97","date":"2026-07-21","released":"2026-07-21","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"75cba343-dc8c-4e13-bd06-7dcf3315f217","number":"96","chapter":"96","title":"Chapter 96","date":"2026-07-13","released":"2026-07-13","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"3c1d7eb1-6673-45bf-a274-cc496a6a18bd","number":"95","chapter":"95","title":"Chapter 95","date":"2026-07-06","released":"2026-07-06","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"f4088a39-02d4-4587-9798-20204ec7295e","number":"94","chapter":"94","title":"Chapter 94","date":"2026-06-29","released":"2026-06-29","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"bb6335bc-247b-4894-be89-cf62e662335d","number":"93","chapter":"93","title":"Chapter 93","date":"2026-06-23","released":"2026-06-23","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"e3245cc5-147b-4266-b739-c17a9ef792ee","number":"92","chapter":"92","title":"Chapter 92","date":"2026-06-16","released":"2026-06-16","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"115e71b6-6605-4000-ae41-fe0be75a0